---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy & Cookie Disclosures" 
  description="Official Privacy Policy for HeliaTech Media, detailing our data protection standards, GDPR/CCPA compliance, and third-party advertising disclosures including Google AdSense."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 py-16">
    <!-- Header Badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-mono mb-8 shadow-glow-cyan">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
      <span>PRIVACY & DATA PROTECTION • REVISED 2026</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6">
      Privacy Policy & <br />
      <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-sky-300 to-fuchsia-400">
        Third-Party Advertising Disclosures
      </span>
    </h1>

    <p class="text-slate-400 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-12">
      At <strong>HeliaTech Media</strong> (<a href="https://heliatech.online" class="text-cyan-400 underline">heliatech.online</a>), accessible from https://heliatech.online, one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information that is collected and recorded by HeliaTech Media and how we use it.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-12 text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- Section 1: General Consent -->
      <section class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-sm">01.</span>
          <span>Consent & Scope</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          By using our website, you hereby consent to our Privacy Policy and agree to its terms. This policy applies only to our online activities and is valid for visitors to our website with regards to the information that they share and/or collect in HeliaTech Media.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you have additional questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact our Data Protection Officer at <a href="mailto:partnership@heliatech.online" class="text-cyan-400 underline font-mono">partnership@heliatech.online</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2: Google AdSense & Cookies Mandatory Disclosure -->
      <section class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-cyan-500/30 shadow-lg shadow-cyan-950/20">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-sm">02.</span>
          <span>Google AdSense & Third-Party Advertising Cookies</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          Google is one of a third-party vendor on our site. It also uses cookies, known as DART cookies, to serve ads to our site visitors based upon their visit to heliatech.online and other sites on the internet.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-400 mb-4 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li>Third party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to your website or other websites.</li>
          <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to your users based on their visit to your sites and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
          <li>Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cyan-400 underline">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
          <li>Alternatively, visitors can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cyan-400 underline">aboutads.info</a>.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Some of our advertising and monetization partners may use cookies and web beacons on our site. Each of our advertising partners has their own Privacy Policy for their policies on user data.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3: Information We Collect -->
      <section class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-sm">03.</span>
          <span>Information We Collect & Server Logs</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          HeliaTech Media follows a standard procedure of using log files and privacy-preserving edge analytics (Cloudflare Web Analytics). These files log visitors when they visit websites:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-400 mb-4 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li>Internet Protocol (IP) addresses (anonymized at edge).</li>
          <li>Browser type, device family, and Operating System.</li>
          <li>Internet Service Provider (ISP) and referring/exit pages.</li>
          <li>Date, time stamp, and aggregated dwell time metrics.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          These are not linked to any information that is personally identifiable. The purpose of the information is for analyzing trends, administering the site, tracking users' movement on the website, and gathering demographic information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4: Newsletter & Direct Communications -->
      <section class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-sm">04.</span>
          <span>Email Subscriptions & Communications</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          If you subscribe to our weekly tech intelligence dispatch (*The Thursday Radar*), we collect solely your email address with explicit double opt-in consent.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-4">
          We never rent, sell, or trade our subscriber lists to third parties. Every email communication contains a one-click unsubscribe link allowing immediate removal from our transactional database.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5: GDPR & CCPA Rights -->
      <section class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-sm">05.</span>
          <span>GDPR & CCPA Data Protection Rights</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          We want to make sure you are fully aware of all of your data protection rights. Every user is entitled to the following:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-400 mb-4 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li><strong>The right to access:</strong> You have the right to request copies of your personal data.</li>
          <li><strong>The right to rectification:</strong> You have the right to request that we correct any information you believe is inaccurate.</li>
          <li><strong>The right to erasure:</strong> You have the right to request that we erase your personal data, under certain conditions.</li>
          <li><strong>The right to object to processing:</strong> You have the right to object to our processing of your personal data.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          If you make a request, we have one month to respond to you. Please contact us at <a href="mailto:partnership@heliatech.online" class="text-cyan-400 underline font-mono">partnership@heliatech.online</a> to exercise any of these rights.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6: Children's Information -->
      <section class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-sm">06.</span>
          <span>Children's Privacy Protection</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          Another part of our priority is adding protection for children while using the internet. We encourage parents and guardians to observe, participate in, and/or monitor and guide their online activity. HeliaTech Media does not knowingly collect any Personal Identifiable Information from children under the age of 13.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>

    <!-- Contact Box -->
    <div class="mt-16 p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-6">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-1">Questions Regarding Privacy?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs">Our compliance desk is available for data inquiry and removal requests.</p>
      </div>
      <a 
        href="mailto:partnership@heliatech.online" 
        class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/20 hover:bg-cyan-500/30 border border-cyan-500/40 text-cyan-300 font-mono text-xs font-bold transition-all"
      >
        partnership@heliatech.online
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
